  {
   "id": "4FEF68A8-EC4E-4B5F-BC4A-968ADB7C5432",
   "title": "Retry with Backoff",
   "description": "Exponential backoff for flaky requests.",
   "language": "Rust",
   "code": "pub async fn retry<F, Fut, T, E>(mut op: F, max: u32) -> Result<T, E>\nwhere\n    F: FnMut() -> Fut,\n    Fut: std::future::Future<Output = Result<T, E>>,\n{\n    let mut delay = 100;\n    for attempt in 0.. {\n        match op().await {\n            Ok(v) => return Ok(v),\n            Err(e) if attempt >= max => return Err(e),\n            Err(_) => tokio::time::sleep(ms(delay)).await,\n        }\n        delay *= 2;\n    }\n    unreachable!()\n}",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-11T11:00:00.000Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T13:00:00.000Z",
   "isFavorite": false,
   "copyCount": 4,
